This project follows the public API of django-pgtrigger
(https://github.com/Opus10/django-pgtrigger, version 4.17.0), so that the same
Django models and triggers can be declared on PostgreSQL and on Db2 for IBM i.
It is not affiliated with or endorsed by django-pgtrigger or its authors.

